    <string name="about_section_companion_title">THE TOURNAMENT COMPANION</string>
    <string name="about_section_companion_desc">WC26 Threads is an open-source, fan-first social companion built for the World Cup. Every match gets its own dedicated live thread, and every hot take gets its own space. Experience a tournament-long fan community centered around what matters: the football.</string>
    <string name="about_section_craft_title">THE ARCHITECTURE &amp; CRAFT</string>
    <string name="about_section_craft_desc">Built end-to-end as a high-fidelity portfolio piece, the project connects a modern, reactive Jetpack Compose Android client with a robust server backend. It demonstrates clean architecture standards, real-time sync, and fluid UX layouts.</string>
